- id: TC_GST_001
  module: gst
  title: GSTR-1 report current month ke liye generate ho
  priority: p1
  tags:
  - smoke
  - gst
  - reports
  expected:
  - Report grid render ho
  - B2B / B2C sections dikhein
  steps:
  - action: open_screen
    target: dashboard
    note: Menu se dashboard kholo (URL se nahi)
  - action: note
    note: GSTR-1 ka real URL confirm karna hai
  - action: click
    target: report.generate
  - action: assert_visible
    target: report.grid
  - action: assert_text
    value: B2B
  draft: true
  preconditions:
  - 'DRAFT: GSTR-1 screen ka naksha abhi nahi bana. dump-one-screen.bat se ''report''
    dump karke locators bharni hain, tab ye test chalega.'
- id: TC_GST_002
  module: gst
  title: GSTR-1 ka B2B total us period ke GSTIN-wale sale invoices se match kare
  priority: p1
  tags:
  - gst
  - reports
  - reconciliation
  expected:
  - Report ka B2B taxable value = sale register ka GSTIN-party total
  steps:
  - action: note
    note: Ye reconciliation case hai -- sale register aur GSTR-1 dono se figure nikaal
      ke compare karo
  - action: open_screen
    target: dashboard
    note: Menu se dashboard kholo (URL se nahi)
  - action: note
    note: GSTR-1 ka real URL confirm karna hai
  - action: click
    target: report.generate
  - action: assert_visible
    target: report.grid
  draft: true
  preconditions:
  - 'DRAFT: GSTR-1 screen ka naksha abhi nahi bana. dump-one-screen.bat se ''report''
    dump karke locators bharni hain, tab ye test chalega.'
- id: TC_GST_003
  module: gst
  title: Future date range dene pe empty state aana chahiye, crash nahi
  priority: p3
  tags:
  - negative
  - reports
  steps:
  - action: open_screen
    target: dashboard
    note: Menu se dashboard kholo (URL se nahi)
  - action: note
    note: GSTR-1 ka real URL confirm karna hai
  - action: fill
    target: report.from_date
    value: 01/01/2099
  - action: fill
    target: report.to_date
    value: 31/01/2099
  - action: click
    target: report.generate
  - action: assert_no_text
    value: Error
  draft: true
  preconditions:
  - 'DRAFT: GSTR-1 screen ka naksha abhi nahi bana. dump-one-screen.bat se ''report''
    dump karke locators bharni hain, tab ye test chalega.'
